\[
h(T)
=
\frac{1}{2\pi i}
\int_\Gamma h(z)(z-T)^{-1}\,dz.
\]
Subtract the two formulas after composing with $C$, then use \cref{thm:resolvent_defect} inside the integral.  The norm estimate follows from the standard contour bound.
\end{proof}

